       "text": "I entered the order as written (Order ID: ORD-0001):\n\n- **Drug and dose:** sertraline 400 mg\n- **Route and frequency:** by mouth, once daily\n- **Note on the order:** \"Dose exceeds labeled maximum (200 mg/day). Attending-confirmed as intended.\"\n\nAt this dose, consider monitoring for serotonin toxicity, QTc (a baseline ECG may help), sodium, and bleeding risk. Review the patient's other medications for interactions as well. I can add an order for an ECG or labs if you want one."
